      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eagle_Point%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Actor Patrick Duffy, a longtime resident of Eagle Point, served as the advisory director to help rebuild the Butte Creek Mill.",
